    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Konfigurasi Kolom CSV (Message Column Config)",
      "id": "details-message-column-config",
      "intro": "Sub-tab Message Column Config adalah fitur unik dan spesifik untuk Interface CSV. Tab ini tidak ada pada pemetaan JSON. Fitur ini memungkinkan pengguna untuk mendefinisikan urutan pembacaan kolom dari file CSV (dari kiri ke kanan) agar sistem ShiFor dapat mengekstrak data dari file eksternal dengan benar.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Daftar & Detail Message Column Config",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Tabel ini mencantumkan struktur kolom dari file CSV dari kiri ke kanan (berdasarkan *Column Index*).\n• Informasi kolom mencakup:\n  - **Column Name:** Nama representatif kolom dalam file CSV.\n  - **Data Type:** Tipe data aktual kolom tersebut (STRING, NUMERIC, AMOUNT, dsb).\n  - **Der Type Enum:** Status kewajiban field ini (MANDATORY, OPTIONAL).\n  - **Index:** Urutan posisi kolom dalam file CSV (dimulai dari 0 untuk kolom pertama). \n• Pastikan pengaturan index berurutan secara logis sesuai dengan struktur file CSV asal yang akan di-upload.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#fffbeb;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Column Config</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#d97706;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">+ Add</span></div><div style=\"padding:0;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:9px;\"><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc;\"><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Idx</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Column Name</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">Type</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\">DER</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#d97706;font-weight:800;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">0</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">TransactionID</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">STRING</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">MANDATORY</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#d97706;font-weight:800;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">1</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">Amount</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">AMOUNT</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">MANDATORY</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#d97706;font-weight:800;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">2</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9;\">CardNumber</td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(217,119,6,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">NUMERIC</span></td><td style=\"padding:6px 10px;\"><span style=\"padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">MANDATORY</span></td></tr></table></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Form Tambah / Edit Message Column Config",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\nDrawer form berukuran **560px** menyediakan field pengisian berikut:\n1. **Column Name** *(Wajib)*: Nama kolom (misal: `TransactionID`, `Amount`, `CardNumber`). Nama ini nanti digunakan untuk pemetaan (mapping) ke Transaction Attribute.\n2. **Data Type** *(Wajib)*: Format data kolom pada CSV. Memilih dari opsi seperti `STRING`, `NUMERIC`, `AMOUNT`, `DATE`, `TIME`, dll.\n3. **Mandatory** *(Wajib)*: Menentukan apakah field ini wajib ada (MANDATORY) atau boleh kosong (OPTIONAL) pada baris CSV tersebut.\n4. **Column Index** *(Wajib)*: Posisi index urutan kolom numerik, dimulai dari **0** untuk kolom paling kiri file CSV.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1);border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fde68a;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#d97706;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 3h7a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-7m0-18H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h7m0-18v18\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create Message Column</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">Fill details and save changes</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:9.5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Column Name <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Enter column name</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Data Type <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose data type</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Mandatory <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">Choose</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Column Index <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></span><div style=\"padding:5px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:5px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;\">0</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-top:1px solid #fde68a;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:5px;background:#d97706;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
